{"id": "3326529", "name": "החלפת סדר אינטגרציה לצורך חישוב – e^(my²)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}\\int_x^{{{CT:0}}} e^{{{CT:1}}}\\,dy\\,dx\\)</p><p>האינטגרל הפנימי בסדר הנתון אינו נוח לחישוב. לאחר החלפת הסדר נכתוב</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_a^b\\int_{c(y)}^{d(y)}e^{{{CT:1}}}\\,dx\\,dy\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>הזינו את הגבולות ואת ערך האינטגרל</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle a=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle b=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle c(y)=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle d(y)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בסדר הנתון צריך פונקציה קדומה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{{{CT:1}}}\\)</span>, שאינה אלמנטרית. משרטטים את התחום, מחליפים את סדר האינטגרציה, ואז מופיע הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> שמאפשר הצבה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — התחום</b><br><p>באינטגרל הנתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\le x\\le {{CT:0}}\\)</span> ולכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\le y\\le {{CT:0}}\\)</span>. התחום הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le y\\le{{CT:0}}\\)</span>: המשולש שקודקודיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,0)\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,{{CT:0}})\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(({{CT:0}},{{CT:0}})\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — החלפת הסדר</b><br><p>בסריקה אופקית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> נע בין <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span> ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span>, ולכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> הערך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> נע מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span> עד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>. לכן לאחר החלפת הסדר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}\\int_0^y e^{{{CT:1}}}\\,dx\\,dy\\)</p><p>כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a=0\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b={{CT:0}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c(y)=0\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d(y)=y\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — חישוב האינטגרל</b><br><p>כעת האינטגרציה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span> מיידית: האינטגרנד אינו תלוי ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_0^y e^{{{CT:1}}}dx=y\\,e^{{{CT:1}}}\\)</span>. את האינטגרל שנותר מחשבים בהצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:1}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dt={{CT:2}}\\,dy\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}y e^{{{CT:1}}}\\,dy=\\frac{e^{{{CT:3}}}-1}{{{CT:4}}}={{CT:5}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if is(equal(ans1,a)) and is(equal(ans2,b)) and is(equal(ans3,cfun)) and is(equal(ans4,dfun)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>הגבולות — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>הגבולות — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "val", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["R", "a", "b", "cfun", "den", "dfun", "expo", "m", "topExpo", "val"], "nvariants": 6}